Z||000026||Mach10||06-09-2001||07:07 PM||||Nice pic. The guy in the background looks stunned  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I don't see what the big fuss is about. The whole lists of topics has crossed the rapids of insanity, and is floating in some pool beyond. So, some girl drives a Fiero, does her own work, and happens to be young. This is reason enough to post 166-topic threads?<BR>My girlfriend is a cutie, loves Fieros, and is not afraid to rip apart a SBC 350 with her bare hands (a little help from a breaker bar for the head-bolts... She doesn't have that much meat on her  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">). I can post a picture if you guys want, but I'd guess that she wouldn't get near as many responses. <P>FieroLisa: I mean no disrespect. I am mildly concussed as to how you can motivate an entire list to repeat themselves over, and over, and over again. BTW, great car. The fact is, though, I don't know you, so I cannot comment.||||reg||5
